{"id":"09634bc7993c92da","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/902_Entailment_Logic.md","title":"902 Entailment Logic","display":"902_Entailment_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"902-Entailment-Logic\">902 Entailment Logic</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为固定可数无限命题原子集合。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{ent},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{neg}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{ent},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{neg}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{ent},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{neg}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{ent},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{neg}\\)</span> 五个构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ent},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ent},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow B\">\\(A\\Rightarrow B\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ent}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{ent}(A,B)\\)</span>。目标特征是把 entailment 作为对象语言的主二元构造子，并使用 entailment 传递规则。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与替换\">2. 公式与替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ent}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ent}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ent}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ent}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>，替换子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ent}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ent}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ent}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ent}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{and}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{or}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{or}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{and}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{or}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{or}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该语言没有绑定构造子。定义有限原子集、绑定名函数与新原子选择函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(F)\\notin F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(F)\\notin F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{At}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{At}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为句法相等：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Ent}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Ent}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-公理族\">3. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}=\\{\\operatorname{ent}(A,A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}=\\{\\operatorname{ent}(A,A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land L0}=\\{\\operatorname{ent}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land L0}=\\{\\operatorname{ent}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land L1}=\\{\\operatorname{ent}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land L1}=\\{\\operatorname{ent}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor R0}=\\{\\operatorname{ent}(A,\\operatorname{or}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor R0}=\\{\\operatorname{ent}(A,\\operatorname{or}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor R1}=\\{\\operatorname{ent}(B,\\operatorname{or}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor R1}=\\{\\operatorname{ent}(B,\\operatorname{or}(A,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义双重否定公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 1}=\\{\\operatorname{ent}(A,\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 1}=\\{\\operatorname{ent}(A,\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 2}=\\{\\operatorname{ent}(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{neg}(A)),A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 2}=\\{\\operatorname{ent}(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{neg}(A)),A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land L0}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land L1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor R0}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor R1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land L0}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land L1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor R0}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor R1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-规则关系\">4. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^n\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^n\\)</span>。以下规则关系均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 的子集。</p>\n<p>定义传递规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}}=\\{((\\operatorname{ent}(A,B),\\operatorname{ent}(B,C));\\operatorname{ent}(A,C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}}=\\{((\\operatorname{ent}(A,B),\\operatorname{ent}(B,C));\\operatorname{ent}(A,C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义合取右规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R}=\\{((\\operatorname{ent}(A,B),\\operatorname{ent}(A,C));\\operatorname{ent}(A,\\operatorname{and}(B,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R}=\\{((\\operatorname{ent}(A,B),\\operatorname{ent}(A,C));\\operatorname{ent}(A,\\operatorname{and}(B,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义析取左规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L}=\\{((\\operatorname{ent}(A,C),\\operatorname{ent}(B,C));\\operatorname{ent}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B),C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L}=\\{((\\operatorname{ent}(A,C),\\operatorname{ent}(B,C));\\operatorname{ent}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B),C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义否定反变规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\neg}=\n\\{((\\operatorname{ent}(A,B));\\operatorname{ent}(\\operatorname{neg}(B),\\operatorname{neg}(A))):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\neg}=\n\\{((\\operatorname{ent}(A,B));\\operatorname{ent}(\\operatorname{neg}(B),\\operatorname{neg}(A))):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义完整规则关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\neg}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\neg}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-证明序列\">5. 证明序列</h1>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，Entailment 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span> 且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>，至少满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i\\in\\Gamma,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=\\operatorname{ent}(B,C)\">\\(A_j=\\operatorname{ent}(B,C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=\\operatorname{ent}(C,D)\">\\(A_k=\\operatorname{ent}(C,D)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\operatorname{ent}(B,D)\">\\(A_i=\\operatorname{ent}(B,D)\\)</span>，\n或存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=\\operatorname{ent}(B,C)\">\\(A_j=\\operatorname{ent}(B,C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=\\operatorname{ent}(B,D)\">\\(A_k=\\operatorname{ent}(B,D)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\operatorname{ent}(B,\\operatorname{and}(C,D))\">\\(A_i=\\operatorname{ent}(B,\\operatorname{and}(C,D))\\)</span>，\n或存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=\\operatorname{ent}(B,D)\">\\(A_j=\\operatorname{ent}(B,D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=\\operatorname{ent}(C,D)\">\\(A_k=\\operatorname{ent}(C,D)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\operatorname{ent}(\\operatorname{or}(B,C),D)\">\\(A_i=\\operatorname{ent}(\\operatorname{or}(B,C),D)\\)</span>。\n或存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 使</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_j=\\operatorname{ent}(B,C),\n\\qquad\nA_i=\\operatorname{ent}(\\operatorname{neg}(C),\\operatorname{neg}(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_j=\\operatorname{ent}(B,C),\n\\qquad\nA_i=\\operatorname{ent}(\\operatorname{neg}(C),\\operatorname{neg}(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>最后四项分别要求对应的前提列与结论属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\neg}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\neg}\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\{\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1}):\\pi\\text{ 是从 }\\Gamma\\text{ 出发的 Entailment 证明且 }A_{n-1}=A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\{\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1}):\\pi\\text{ 是从 }\\Gamma\\text{ 出发的 Entailment 证明且 }A_{n-1}=A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-可导性\">6. 可导性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Ent}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Ent}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证明证书集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-定理集合\">7. 定理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Ent}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Ent}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Entailment Logic 的核心差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EntCore}\n=\n(\\operatorname{ent},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 2},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\neg},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EntCore}\n=\n(\\operatorname{ent},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 2},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\neg},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}=\\operatorname{EntCore}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}=\\operatorname{EntCore}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{Ent}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 2},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\neg},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\operatorname{EntCore},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{Ent}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\neg 2},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{trans}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\neg},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{Ent}},\\operatorname{EntCore},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义 entailment logic 的句法推导关系；不含 Routley-Meyer 语义、融合或模态框。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"902-Entailment-Logic","text":"902 Entailment Logic","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与替换","text":"2. 公式与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-公理族","text":"3. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"4.-规则关系","text":"4. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"5.-证明序列","text":"5. 证明序列","level":1},{"id":"6.-可导性","text":"6. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"7.-定理集合","text":"7. 定理集合","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{ent},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{neg}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{ent},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{neg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ent},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\Rightarrow B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ent}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ent}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ent}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}","display":true},{"tex":"A[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[\\sigma]),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ent}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ent}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{and}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{or}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{or}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(F)\\notin F.","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{At}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Ent}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Ent}}B\\Longleftr